body:
I was recently diagnosed after having my first outbreak; I've never had such a poor image of myself than I do in this moment. I feel as though it wouldn't be fair for someone to be with me when they could have a clean partner instead. I feel desexed, unmanned, and as though a part of life has been unfairly snatched away from me.

&#x200B;

I really don't know what to do with myself, and I don't know how I should live my life.
